  "answer": "Nvidia's net income for Q3 FY2025 was $19.3 billion, significantly beating analyst estimates by 9.46% [Source: earnings-nvda-001]. The company reported a year-over-year revenue growth of 93.6%, driven primarily by the data center segment, which generated $30.8 billion in revenue [Source: earnings-nvda-001]. Regarding future outlook, Nvidia has raised its revenue forecast for Q4 FY2025 to approximately $37.5 billion (+/- 2%), above the Street consensus of $37.1 billion at the time of guidance [Source: guidance-nvda-001]. Additionally, in Q3 FY2025, Nvidia guided Q3 FY2025 revenue to approximately $32.5 billion, slightly exceeding analyst estimates [Source: guidance-nvda-002].",
